# Private board files a user may drop in the repo root while iterating
# on their own designs (this is the tool's home, not their PCB library).
# Test fixtures live under tests/fixtures/ and are never named this way,
# so those aren't caught by these patterns.
/SCH_*.json
/PCB_*.json
/*.fixed.json
